      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "All composite references include tenant_id; exact complete FK definitions are inside each table. Partial UNIQUE indexes do not imply global 1:1.",
      "originalText": "All composite references include tenant_id; exact complete FK definitions are inside each table. Partial UNIQUE indexes do not imply global 1:1.",
